---
import Window from "../ui/Window.astro";
---

<section id="about">
    <Window title="about.txt">
        <p>
            I'm curious by nature and enjoy understanding how things work,
            exploring different approaches, and finding the right balance
            between simplicity, performance, and maintainability. I like taking
            ownership of features from initial design through deployment.
        </p>
        <p>
            At PixBet, I helped build an iGaming platform from scratch before
            moving into a backend team lead role, overseeing architecture,
            infrastructure, and production delivery. Later, at Critical
            TechWorks, I worked on in-vehicle software for BMW and Rolls-Royce.
        </p>
        <p>
            Outside of work, I enjoy tinkering with computers, working on my
            car, playing bass, rock climbing, and spending time outdoors.
            Recently, I've picked up fishing, which has been another fun thing
            to learn. I like having a mix of interests and trying something new.
        </p>
    </Window>
</section>

<style>
    section {
        margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    p {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0.4rem 1.5rem;
        color: var(--text);

        &:first-child {
            padding-top: 1.2rem;
        }

        &:last-child {
            padding-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        & + p {
            position: relative;
            padding-top: 1.5rem;

            &::before {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                top: 0.5rem;
                left: 1.5rem;
                right: 1.5rem;
                border-top: 2px dashed var(--accent1);
            }
        }
    }
</style>
